,"equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1021","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,45,68,80,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,45,68,80,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1021","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,45,68,80,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,45,68,80,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"甄俨的嫡子，文昭甄皇后的侄子。因是魏明帝曹叡的表兄弟而备受重用。甄像继承外祖父甄逸的爵位，曾任虎贲中郎将、散骑常侍。建兴十二年，东吴进犯，甄像被任命为伏波将军，持节督师东征。次年去世，追赠卫将军，谥贞侯。","tc":"甄儼的嫡子，文昭甄皇后的侄子。因是魏明帝曹叡的表兄弟而備受重用。甄像繼承外祖父甄逸的爵位，曾任虎賁中郎將、散騎常侍。建興十二年，東吳進犯，甄像被任命為伏波將軍，持節督師東征。次年去世，追贈衛將軍，謚貞侯。","en":"The legitimate son of Zhen Yan and nephew of Empress Wenzhao (Lady Zhen). He was heavily favored and relied upon as a cousin of Cao Rui, Emperor Ming of Wei. Zhen Xiang inherited the noble title of his maternal grandfather Zhen Yi, and served as General of the Rapid Tigers and Cavalier Attendant-in-Ordinary. In the twelfth year of Jianxing, when Eastern Wu invaded, Zhen Xiang was appointed General Who Calms the Waves and granted credentials to command troops on an eastern expedition. He passed away the following year, was posthumously named Guard Captain, and received the posthumous name Marquis Zhen.","jp":"甄儼の嫡男であり、文昭甄皇后の甥。魏の明帝・曹叡の従兄弟にあたることから大いに重用された。外祖父・甄逸の爵位を継承し、虎賁中郎将や散騎常侍を歴任した。建興十二年、東呉が侵犯すると伏波将軍に任じられ、節を持して軍を督し東征した。翌年世を去り、衛将軍を追贈され、貞侯と諡された。","kr":"견엄의 적자이자 문소견황후의 조카. 위 명제 조예의 표형제였기에 크게 중용되었다. 견상은 외조부 견일의 작위를 계승하여 호분중랑장, 산기상시 등을 역임했다. 건흥 12년, 동오가 침공하자 견상은 복파장군에 임명되어 지절로서 군을 통솔해 동정에 나섰다. 이듬해 세상을 떠나 위장군에 추증되었으며, 시호는 정후이다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1038815","remark":"普武","surname":"甄","surnameTc":"甄","surnameEn":"Zhen","surnameJp":"甄","surnameKr":"견","surnameOther":"","name":"像","nameTc":"像","nameEn":"Xiang","nameJp":"像","nameKr":"상","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"甄像","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"210","city":"CS1021","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"45","wise":"68","politics":"80","charm":"70","will":"65","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"6/6/60/6/6/7/18/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1200","battleSoulPoint":"500","debateSoulPoint":"5700","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001001","professions":"0/0/0/0/3/0/0/1/1/0/2/0/2/4/0/2/1/1/2/4/1/0/0/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"18","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth"